"2387\">Print Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2404\" data-col-size=\"sm\">CMYK branding<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2422\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10pt\u201328pt board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2439\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Soft touch, UV<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2455\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Logo and text<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2474\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate gifting<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2589\">\n<td data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2494\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2493\">Strength Level<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2518\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Supports heavier swag<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2539\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrugated options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2555\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Smooth finish<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2572\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Custom pockets<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2589\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Employee events<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2696\">\n<td data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2605\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2604\">Size Range<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2627\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Custom size options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2647\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Premium cardboard<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2647\" data-end=\"2661\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte\/gloss<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2678\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Extra sections<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2696\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Merchandise kits<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2 data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2751\">Template Layouts For Consistent Employee Swag Sets<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"3182\">Cardboard welcome kit boxes with internal sections help HR departments organize items in a structured, meaningful, and orderly way. Many offices\u00a0<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">use <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/Cosmetic-and-Gift-Cardboard-Boxes\/\"><strong>Cosmetic and Gift Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a>\u00a0for an onboarding style that offers a gift-like presentation while remaining<\/span>\u00a0simple and corporate. Template-driven layouts support notebooks, badges, accessories, and message inserts with clean visual balance.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3551\">This organized structure reduces shifting during courier handling and keeps each item aligned for a neat opening view. It also helps teams maintain a consistent kit appearance across different hiring cycles and office locations. With a stable base format, branding updates, theme changes, and seasonal item swaps can be made without changing the core layout approach.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"3553\" data-end=\"3604\">How Template-Based Kits Keep Layouts Consistent<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3606\" data-end=\"3932\">Template-style interiors guide item placement by size, weight, and category, which reduces clutter and improves the first look inside the box. This makes the kit feel deliberate, with each piece placed for a clear reason. For new employees, that sense of order can support confidence in how the company plans and communicates.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3934\" data-end=\"4225\">These layouts also help HR teams prepare kits in advance with fewer last-minute adjustments. When inserts and compartments are designed around predictable merchandise sizes, packing becomes faster and more accurate. This supports consistent results even when different teams handle assembly.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4227\" data-end=\"4254\"><strong data-start=\"4227\" data-end=\"4254\">Key Points For HR Teams<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4255\" data-end=\"4443\">\n<li data-start=\"4255\" data-end=\"4305\">\n<p data-start=\"4257\" data-end=\"4305\">Supports multi-item kits with neat arrangement<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4306\" data-end=\"4364\">\n<p data-start=\"4308\" data-end=\"4364\">Helps maintain a consistent look for onboarding events<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4365\" data-end=\"4401\">\n<p data-start=\"4367\" data-end=\"4401\">Reduces movement during shipping<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4402\" data-end=\"4443\">\n<p data-start=\"4404\" data-end=\"4443\">Supports a clear branded presentation<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4445\" data-end=\"4478\"><strong data-start=\"4445\" data-end=\"4478\">Practical Onboarding Outcomes<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4479\" data-end=\"4686\">\n<li data-start=\"4479\" data-end=\"4535\">\n<p data-start=\"4481\" data-end=\"4535\">Useful for cardboard welcome kit boxes for employees<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4536\" data-end=\"4585\">\n<p data-start=\"4538\" data-end=\"4585\">Supports company events and creative launches<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4586\" data-end=\"4635\">\n<p data-start=\"4588\" data-end=\"4635\">Creates a uniform layout across welcome packs<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4636\" data-end=\"4686\">\n<p data-start=\"4638\" data-end=\"4686\">Helps with swag box distribution for employees<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"5258\">\n<thead data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4811\">\n<tr data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4811\">\n<th data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4700\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4699\">Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4714\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4702\" data-end=\"4713\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"4714\" data-end=\"4737\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4716\" data-end=\"4736\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-